Hi Listmates,

I need a little bit help in Splus programming.

I had day1 data

 Date     time price
 1998-12-01 00:00:38   5.5
 1998-12-01  9:40:40   4.9
 1998-12-01 10:10:10   5.0
 1998-12-01 20:40:10   5.1
 1998-12-01 21:10:10   5.3
 1998-12-01 23:59:04   5.0

then day2

 1998-12-02 00:00:30   6.0
 1998-12-02  9:05:05   5.9
 1998-12-02 10:30:30   5.5
 1998-12-02 20:50:01   6.0
 1998-12-02 21:20:20   6.3
 1998-12-02 23:58:00   6.0 and so on

I needed price closest to 10:10:00 and 21:00:00 and used

AMPM <- function(day)
{
        TEN <- chron(times = "10:00:00")
        TWENTYONE <- chron(times = "21:00:00")
        attach(day, pos = 2)
        on.exit(detach("day"))
        times <- chron(times = day[, 2])
        AMdiffs <- abs(times - TEN)
        AM <- (1:length(times))[AMdiffs == min(AMdiffs)]
        PMdiffs <- abs(times - TWENTYONE)
        PM <- (1:length(times))[PMdiffs == min(PMdiffs)]
