On Thu, 11 Mar 1999, Eugene Dubossarsky wrote:

> We are having an "interesting" time trying to estimate parameters for
> Multinomial Logit (MNL) models using Ripley's multinom, and S-Plus'
> inherent glm binomial logit. Both have presented problems.
> Both appear to have trouble with low rank data sets (more columns than
