Hello.

Here is what I am trying to do. I have a vector of length n. I also have a
set of vectors, also length n, which are factors. What I want to do is
create a vector z of length n such that a given element (z_i) is a
specified function of those y for which the factor levels of a specified
subset of the factors are the same as those of the z_i. That is, for a
given y_i, z_i is a specified function of all the y_i in the same "cell" as
