In working with collaborators who use Word and PowerPoint it is very nice to
be able to export a graph to a .wmf file.   These files can easily be brought
into Word, PowerPoint, etc., and they can be edited using one of the best
graphics editors I've seen, Metafile Companion (www.CompanionSoftware.com),
or edited inside Word etc., without requiring linkage back to S-Plus.
